       SET post_id as length of posts + 1
       CREATE new BlogPost object with post_id, title, content
       SAVE new BlogPost object to posts.txt
       RETURN None

   FUNCTION new_post_handler:
       IF request method is POST:
           GET title, content from form
           CALL create_post(title, content)
           REDIRECT to main blog page
   ```

4. **test_view_blog_posts**
